1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
<font color="#ffffff">Is the ferry on time today?</font>

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,000
<font color="#ffff00">It left ten minutes early.</font>

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">Early? Then we take the bus.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The bus is faster anyway.</font>

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,500
<font color="#00ffff">Welcome back to the show.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Clara.</font>

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,000
<font color="#ffff00"><i>The harbour is closed</i></font>
<font color="#ffff00"><i>until Monday.</i></font>

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,000
The announcement ends here.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,400
<font color="#00ffff">We meet again next week.</font>
